  ;; Main schematic as hierarchical text description
  ;; (Full schematic symbols would be placed here in actual KiCad file)
  ;; This is a template - use KiCad to add actual symbols

  (text "=== COMPONENT PLACEMENT GUIDE ===\n\nThis schematic file provides the structure.\nOpen in KiCad and add components from libraries:\n\n1. CH224K - Use generic SOP-10 symbol, rename pins\n2. MP2359 - Available in KiCad default library\n3. USB-C connector - Connector_USB:USB_C_Receptacle_USB2.0\n4. DC Jack - Connector_BarrelJack:BarrelJack_Horizontal\n5. A4988 Socket - Use Connector_PinHeader:PinHeader_2x08_P2.54mm\n6. Passives - Use standard 0603/0805 footprints\n\nSee SCHEMATIC.md for complete wiring details."
    (at 101.6 203.2 0)
